# The Docker build context is the repo root (see apps/api/Dockerfile). None of this needs to
# reach the daemon: node_modules is reinstalled inside the image from the lockfile, build output
# is regenerated, docs are never shipped, and a stray .env must never end up baked into a layer.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.next

docs
*.md
!apps/**/README.md

.git
.gitignore

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.*.example

.vscode
.idea
*.log
